{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RP-01 D2 approved and experimentally specified. Retry-wire policy: send the complete failed ModelResponse only when the complete retry deterministically fits; otherwise omit that response whole from a copied model_request context. Never prefix-truncate it and never mutate stored Agent history. Source/system/user/tool input, accepted output, and the final-failure artifact remain complete. Output-size policy is an intentional behavior change: length/max_tokens is rejected before parse/repair, then consumes the existing bounded output-retry allowance with the exact guidance “Make your response as concise as possible while fulfilling the prompt and output format requirements.” Refusal/content-filter remains terminal after one call and output-size failure still does not trigger provider fallback.\n\nFit rule: for every viable candidate, require a known Rebar context window and Pydantic count_tokens result for the full message/settings/request-parameter shape, then require input_tokens + effective max_tokens <= window. FallbackModel itself has no count_tokens implementation, so the capability iterates the already-built candidate models. Unknown window/count selects whole-response omission; count the omitted shape too and fail closed if authoritative inputs still cannot fit. Optional count calls do not consume Agent request_limit and are labeled separately in telemetry.\n\nOffline command: rtk env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" python .joe-janitor/rp01-pydantic-native-probe.py. Result: Pydantic AI 1.107.2, offline=true, 28 observations. All-or-nothing branches sent respectively all 5,000 and zero failed-response characters on retry while both retained 5,000 in result.all_messages(); output-size→valid used 2 calls with the exact guidance; repeated output-size exhausted 3; content-filter/refusal used 1. Live authorized count probes (credentials not printed/persisted): Anthropic full/omitted 4,582/3,950 input tokens; Bedrock 4,599/3,966. Updated artifacts: .joe-janitor/rp01-pydantic-native-probe.py, .joe-janitor/rp01-cache-live-probe.py, .joe-janitor/rp01-pydantic-native-research.md, and .joe-janitor/report-2026-08-16-recovered.md. Next unresolved decision: successful-retry usage accounting."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786912365131674001,"uuid":"e75b8d38-2be4-4159-a8c8-6a52de689227"}